n responsive communication and you are always welcome to reach out to a member of our team for guidance or to discuss a referral.\nTo make a referral, please complete this form with pertinent information about your patient.\nReferral Form\nrDVM Partner Discount Pre-Registration\nAccess Your\nPatients’ Medical Records\nPlease note that for each of our locations you will need to set up access and the same username and password can be used.\nIf you have not yet set up your account on the Patient Portal, please take a moment to look through our\nPatient Portal Guide\n.\nBrooklyn Park\nPatient Records\nMinneapolis\nPatient Records\nEau Claire\nPatient Records\nRochester\nPatient Records\nEden Prairie\nPatient Records\nSign Up for\nThe Allied Ally\nThe Allied Ally is our monthly enewsletter for the veterinary community. Receive valuable insights, continuing education opportunities, and practical tools to enhance collaborative care for your patients. Sign up below!\nThe Allied Ally Newsletter\n*\nindicates required\nEmail Address\n*\nFirst Name\n*\nLast Name\n*\nPractice Name\n*\nRole\nDVM\nVeterinary Technician\nPractice Manager\nClient Services\nClosest Allied Location\n*\nBrooklyn Park\nMinneapolis\nEau Claire\nRochester\nEden Prairie\nPast Editions:\nNovember 2025 - It's That Time of Year and You're Invited!\nOctober 2025 - Are You Seeing Any New Trends in Emergency Cases?\nSeptember 2025 - The Making of a Great Veterinary Employee\nAugust 2025 - DVM Q&A: Any Advice for Helping Our Veterinary Technicians Gain Confidence with Dosing?\nJuly 2025 - Unmatched Technology and Equipment\nJune 2025 - New Journeys, New Impact\nMay 2025 - Specialty Surgical Care at Affordable Costs\nApril 2025 - Oncology and Surgery Services Available Now\nMarch 2025 - Collaborative Care in Action: Junie's Case\nFebruary 2025 - Investing in Patient Care with New Advanced Technologies:  128-slice CT Scanner and 3D C-Arm\nJanuary 2025 - Veterinary Partner Discount Program Now Available\nDecember 2024 - New Locations: Rochester and Eden Prairie\nContact Us\nBrooklyn Park\nEau Claire\nEden Prairie\nMinneapolis\nRochester\nHugo\nQuick Links\nEmergency Services\nSpecialty Care\nSurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nCardiology\nFacebook\nInstagram\n© 2024 – 2026 Allied Veterinary Emergency & Referral. All rights reserved.\nScroll Up",
